  "solution": {
    "text": "In aqueous alkaline solution, two electron reduction of $\\mathrm{HO}_{2}^{-}$ gives OH The reaction is as follows:\n$\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{2} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{H}^{+}+\\mathrm{HO}_{2}^{-} \\\\\n\\mathrm{HO}_{2}^{-}+\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}+2 e^{-} \\rightleftharpoons 3 \\mathrm{OH}\n\\end{array}$",
